    "text": "| y=f(x) | $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=f'(x)$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| k, constant | 0 |\n| x | 1 |\n| $x^2$ | 2x |\n| $x^3$ | $3x^2$ |\n| $x^n$, any constant n | $nx^{n-1}$ |\n| $\\mathrm{e}^x$ | $\\mathrm{e}^x$ |\n| $\\mathrm{e}^{kx}$ | $ke^{kx}$ |\n| $\\ln kx=\\log_{\\mathrm{e}}kx$ | $\\frac{1}{x}$ |",
