    "text": "$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (u (x) \\pm v (x)) = \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\pm \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x}\n$$",
    "formula_latex": "\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (u (x) \\pm v (x)) = \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\pm \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x}",
