    "content_type": "formula",
    "text": "$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (k \\times f (x)) = k \\times \\frac {\\mathrm{d} f}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\left. \\right\\rfloor\n$$",
    "formula_latex": "\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (k \\times f (x)) = k \\times \\frac {\\mathrm{d} f}{\\mathrm{d} x}\\left. \\right\\rfloor",
