    "text": "$$\n\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (u v) = u \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x} + v \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\quad \\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\left(\\frac {u}{v}\\right) = \\frac {v \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} - u \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x}}{v ^{2}}\n$$",
    "formula_latex": "\\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} (u v) = u \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x} + v \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\quad \\frac {\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d} x} \\left(\\frac {u}{v}\\right) = \\frac {v \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} - u \\frac {\\mathrm{d} v}{\\mathrm{d} x}}{v ^{2}}",
    "image_path": null
