    "text": "$$\n\\text {If} y = y (u) \\text {where} u = u (x) \\text {then} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} = \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} y} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x}\n$$",
    "formula_latex": "\\text {If} y = y (u) \\text {where} u = u (x) \\text {then} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x} = \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} y} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\mathrm{d} x}",
